Package: agent-sphere
Version: 0.2.0-2
Architecture: all
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MoteBus Engineering <engineering@ypcloud.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/motebus/agent-sphere-deb
Depends: sphered (>= 4.1.0-2), moted (>= 3.6.0-2), mote-proxy (>= 2.0.0-5), mote-transportd (>= 2.0.0-6), mlink (>= 2.1.0-1), mote-secd (>= 1.0.0-2), agos (>= 2.1.0-1), model-router (>= 0.1.0-1), model-llm (>= 0.1.0-3), mote-mcpd (>= 3.0.0-3), cx-mesh (>= 1.1.0-1), init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: Agent Sphere headless core composition
 Composes Agent intelligence, model execution, CX Mesh, MCP, Mote
 transport, security and local I/O runtimes using native APT and DPKG.
 Management interfaces, local Ultra infrastructure and user applications
 are separate entry packages. This package contains no TUI or daemon.
